INTERPRETATION GUIDE:

1. project train->dev padding_only ~0.50
   => padding width was not a useful attack-label shortcut inside the training distribution.

2. Digital-3 same-source padding_match == 1.0
   => padding cannot explain the paired Digital-3 score increase/decrease relative to its own parent.

3. Official Digital-3 vs bona padding_only substantially >0.50
   => padding encodes card-population/domain information and could contribute to the catastrophic official inversion.

4. If that remains high under shared_hardware, the effect is not merely iphone15pro vs iphone15 composition.

5. Large |Spearman rho| between pad_total_r512 and frozen CNN scores would make a causal padding perturbation worth running next.

6. Geometry discrimination alone does NOT prove the CNN uses padding. Only a controlled padding intervention can establish that.

Stop here before changing preprocessing or retraining.
